A Georgian weather reply came out with Persian digits („ტენიანობა ۵۴-۸۸%").
Live, 14 days: 1 assistant message in 122,266. scrubFinal now turns
Arabic-Indic and Extended Arabic-Indic digits into 0-9 first, so the phone
scrub, which reads 0-9, also sees them. No new text. The way-in half of
3106 (the weather line with as_goal) was handled earlier and wants a
re-test.

